flowchart TD
    T[New task] --> Q1{Can I verify the output?}
    Q1 -->|No| K[Keep human in the loop]
    Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Is it multi-file or long-running?}
    Q2 -->|No| D1[Use chat surface]
    Q2 -->|Yes| Q3{Can I scope it precisely?}
    Q3 -->|No| K
    Q3 -->|Yes| D2[Delegate via orchestrator]
    D2 --> S[Write task spec + sentinel]
    S --> E[Spawn isolated executor]
    E --> M[Monitor + steer]
    M --> R[Review true footprint]
    R --> P{Pass review?}
    P -->|No| S
    P -->|Yes| A[Accept / merge]
    K --> L[Learn and try again]

    style D2 fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#60a5fa,color:#fff
    style R fill:#22c55e,stroke:#4ade80,color:#fff
